@* HelpChecklistPage: help topic "Checklist" at "/help/checklist". Static text and screenshots. *@
@page "/help/checklist"

<HelpTopicFrame Slug="checklist">
    <section class="card">
        <p>Every review has a checklist of checks grouped in sections. Answer each check <strong>Pass</strong>,
            <strong>Fail</strong> or <strong>N/A</strong>. A Fail or N/A needs a short justification. A section that
            does not apply to the review can be switched off, with a reason.</p>
        <figure class="help-figure">
            <img class="help-shot" src="/help/checklist-1.png" loading="lazy"
                 alt="The Checklist page with the progress summary, the Next unanswered check button and the first section with Pass, Fail and N/A buttons." />
            <figcaption>The checklist of a review.</figcaption>
        </figure>
    </section>
</HelpTopicFrame>
